<title>FRANCE: Non-residents net buyers French govt bonds in Jan.</title>
<headline>Non-residents net buyers French govt bonds in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Figures released by the finance ministry showed non-resident investors bought a net 7.35 billion francs of French government bonds (OATs and BTANs) in January.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following unadjusted breakdown (in billions of francs) of the financial account in its balance of payment figures.</p>
<p>						  Jan	Dec   Jan 96</p>
<p> DIRECT INVESTMENT			  5.69    -7.43    7.43</p>
<p>     - French investment abroad	-2.20   -25.93   -5.55</p>
<p>     - foreign investment in France   7.89    18.50   12.98</p>
<p> PORTFOLIO INVESTMENT		   -18.90   -21.67  -56.40</p>
<p>  Residents in foreign securities   -32.42   -20.61  -36.88</p>
<p>     - shares			     -15.41    21.80   -6.50</p>
<p>     - bonds				-20.32   -40.64  -13.64</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	 4.99    -5.79  -17.41</p>
<p>     - derivative products	     -1.73     4.02    0.66</p>
<p>  Non-residents in French securities 13.57    -1.06  -19.52</p>
<p>     - shares				 6.04     5.55    7.53</p>
<p>     - bonds				  5.90     6.80  -26.11</p>
<p>     - govt securities(OATs, BTANs)   7.35    -6.08  -19.92</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	 1.63   -13.41   -0.94</p>
<p> OTHER INVESTMENTS			-30.24    -1.57   51.99</p>
<p> - Credits				  -86.56    67.88    6.21</p>
<p> - Liabilities			     56.32   -69.45   45.77</p>
<p> RESERVE ASSETS			    -3.04    -0.02    0.03</p>
<p> TOTAL FINANCIAL ACCOUNT		-46.49   -30.69    3.05</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
